# Git Conventions

## Branch naming

```
feat/{ticket-short-description}
fix/{ticket-short-description}
chore/{ticket-short-description}
```

## Commits (Conventional Commits)

```
feat: add platform payload endpoint
fix: return 404 when mission not found
chore: bump springdoc version
refactor: extract geo validation to shared
test: cover requireById missing case
docs: update openapi spec
```

- Subject ≤ 50 characters
- Body explains **why**, not what (what is visible in the diff)
- One logical change per commit
- Do not mix changes across services in a single commit
